[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6069.75, "timestamp": "01:41:09", "text": "直播没有直播吗？不。呃，因为呃，两台电脑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6074.07, "timestamp": "01:41:14", "text": "设置好之后，这就是二的幂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6077.91, "timestamp": "01:41:17", "text": "电脑设置。我的主 OBS 系统还没死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6081.35, "timestamp": "01:41:21", "text": "这台电脑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6084.39, "timestamp": "01:41:24", "text": "这显而易见，我的FS显而易见"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6088.55, "timestamp": "01:41:28", "text": "我做我的外部F操作，我的主要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6090.55, "timestamp": "01:41:30", "text": "很明显，如果它被压碎，那就彻底完蛋了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6092.07, "timestamp": "01:41:32", "text": "现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6095.27, "timestamp": "01:41:35", "text": "这仅用于发送“呃，发送呃”之类的操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6098.55, "timestamp": "01:41:38", "text": "从这里到那里的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6103.51, "timestamp": "01:41:43", "text": "播放呃到呃主设置。是啊，想想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6106.629, "timestamp": "01:41:46", "text": "它就像是从……发送的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6108.95, "timestamp": "01:41:48", "text": "呃，这简直是显而易见的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6110.87, "timestamp": "01:41:50", "text": "它。"}]